# Goodix gt9916 touchscreen. Its driver reports the double tap gesture as KEY_POWER, at
# times twice in a row, which the framework takes for a power button double press and
# opens the camera. Map it to WAKEUP so that it only wakes the screen. The FOD (338) and
# single tap (354) keys stay unmapped, as with Generic.kl.

key 116   WAKEUP
